NCT07784829.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* age≥18 years;
* patient-reported diagnosis of neurogenic bladder;
* using urethral or suprapubic catheterization for bladder management;
* presenting for suspected symptomatic UTI; and
